Subject: [PATCH] Add CRC16 PMULL optimization and correctness tests

---
 src/Makefile                  |  41 +++-
 src/crc16.c                   | 183 ++++++++++++++-
 src/crc16_xmodem_dispatch.c   |  37 +++
 src/crc16_xmodem_pmull.S      | 140 ++++++++++++
 src/crc16_xmodem_pmull_8way.S | 409 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/crc16_xmodem_short.S      | 342 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 1145 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
